# 🌍 ThermaVista

AI-Powered Urban Heat Island Detection and Cooling Recommendation System

## Features

- 🛰 Satellite Viewer
- 🌿 NDVI Analysis
- 🌡 Land Surface Temperature
- 📊 Interactive Dashboard
- 🤖 AI Heat Prediction
- 🌳 Smart Recommendations
- 🔥 Heat Risk Map

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- Google Earth Engine
- Scikit-learn
- Plotly
- Folium
- Pandas

## Installation

git clone ...

pip install -r requirements.txt

streamlit run app/streamlit_app.py

